green cargo shorts. The ivory-and-sage palette feels polished, relaxed, and easy to photograph.</p>\n\n<p>The dress side keeps the look breezy and floaty, while the shirt-and-shorts side leans casual and practical with real pocket detail. Pack it for vacation mornings, seaside dinners, theme-park days, or any family outing where you want everyone coordinated without feeling overly dressed.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Four-role coordination:</strong> One listing covers girl dress, mother dress, boy shirt, father shirt, and the matching cargo-short rows for boys and dads.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Airy ivory texture:</strong> The soft vertical texture keeps the dress and shirt looking bright, clean, and easy for summer styling.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Relaxed cargo shorts:</strong> Roomy pull-on shorts add movement, pocket space, and an easy utility feel for active days.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Shirt-and-dress balance:</strong> The layered dress keeps the moms' and girls' side floaty while the collared shirt adds polish for boys and dads.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Vacation-ready palette:</strong> Ivory and sage feel calm, coastal, and easy to photograph on beach trips, city walks, and family dinners.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose the dress, shirt, and shorts sizes you need, and build a family matching look that feels clean, calm, and ready for the next sunny memory.</p>","tags":["Asymmetrical Dress","Beach","Boy Shirt","Boy Shorts","Cargo Shorts","Child 1-2 Years","Child 2 Years","Child 3 Years","Child 4 Years","Child 5 Years","Child 6-7 Years","Child 8 Years","Child 9-10 Years","Collared Shirt","Cream","Daddy and Me","Dress","Family Matching","Father 2XL","Father 3XL","Father L","Father M","Father S","Father Shirt","Father Shorts","Father XL","Four-Role Matching","Girl Dress","Gray","Green","https://detail.1688.com/offer/1042999501331.html","Ivory","Ivory Stripe Cargo","Matching Family Dress","Matching Family Outfits","Matching Family Set","Matching Family Shirt","Matc